If you want to allow the attribute to be modified, but only in certain ways or under certain conditions, you can add a setter method to the property:

```python
class MyClass:
    def __init__(self, some_value):
        self._some_attr = some_value

    @property
    def some_attr(self):
        return self._some_attr

    @some_attr.setter
    def some_attr(self, value):
        if value < 0:
            raise ValueError("Value can not be negative")
        self._some_attr = value
